Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but\Nyou're definitely not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Riff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make short work of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another playing card?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Joestar, welcome to our abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the butler of this\Nmansion you may call me Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby huh yes I am the younger\NDarby it might interest you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to know the Darby whom you\Ndefeated upon your arrival was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my older brother so there\Nisn't just one so loud in the
