Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby family so I take it you're\Nhere to avenge your brother's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:01:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat? Not at all. Such a thing is\Nbeneath me. I would have assumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my brother would share his motto\Nwith you it is the deceived not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the deceiver who holds the blame i\Ntoo live by this adage my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lost so he is the wrongdoer i harbor\Nno ill will toward any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother is my brother and I\Nam me, two different individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, my brother and I\Nwere born ten years apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and while I did look up to\Nhim to a certain extent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he and I are of different generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother tried to win via\Nold-fashioned deception,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this method is only useful against\Nthose who are outdated or inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Dio realized\Nthis sad truth as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why he kept me by his\Nside as his personal butler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is my offer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to fight me, then I invite\Nyou to enter our manor. Stay on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's even more conniving than his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take us to Dio right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dojuro, stay on your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby Younger, his stand hailing\Nfrom the Egyptian pantheon is Atum.
