Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, he just brought out his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, his stand is\Nphysically showing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you decide who\Nshall be my first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if we'd listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, take this weirdo down.
