Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wager that Star\NPlatinum's first attack will...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be with his left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it'll be a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much would you care to bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which arm doesn't matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One punch will finish it. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it already, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoorah!
