Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His speed is insane! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a bit of bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, it appears as\Nthough I've lost the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like my brother, I also enjoy a round of\Ngambling, but luck is never on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take you to a\Nwonderful world to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? A bit? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all subterfuge! Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's falling into the abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more the merrier and all that, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar cocky we know it's too\Ndangerous for us to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me if you\Ndon't hear from us in 10
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minutes Torch the mansion\Ndo you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn it to the ground Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.16,0:04:11.25,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(753,855)\pos(146,877)}Episode 40: D'Arby the Player, Part 1 {Ik it says Player but come on man, D'Arby the Gambler and D'Arby the Gamer is too good to not be used}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we still above ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did he pull us under?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this stuff is really an\Nillusion, they've got watered down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff feels so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy\Ntrying to accomplish here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See if you can figure out his ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It knew without a doubt that I\Nwould throw a right-handed punch.
