Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.58,0:04:51.62,SFXPurple2 - Copy,F1,0,0,0,,{=23}{\blur0.9\pos(784.35,107.59)\frz11.77\c&H000000&}Boom
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.58,0:04:51.62,SFXPurple2 - Copy,F1,0,0,0,,{=23}{\bord0\blur0.9\pos(784.35,107.59)\frz11.77\4a&HFF&}Boom
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't figure it out soon,\Nwe're gonna lose, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you care to wet your whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're real, and I assure\Nyou they're not poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we inside the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the mansion are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you that. The basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this illusion the\Nwork of a stand's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is all this the doing of your stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it Dio's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose stand, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would rather not reveal that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation has reported\Nthere are two to three more stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that accurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not reveal that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're about as helpful\Nas a cramp in a relay race.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it means so much, I could lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unlike my dearly defeated brother, I\Nprefer not to resort to petty trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make sure I've got this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying if we don't defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to get\Nback to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've pieced it together, good sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That obnoxious gentlemanly demeanor is\Nbeginning to wear thin on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be forgetting\Nthat it's three against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're short on time, so you'll have to\Ndeal with all of us attacking at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take a load off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on what\NI have to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your collection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much like my brother, I'm what you\Nmight call a humble collector of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all collectors must yearn to share their\Ntreasures for that moment of praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could he possibly\Nbe doing with these toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:06:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, this guy is Darby's brother, so\NI'm guessing those aren't ordinary dolls.
