Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, talk to me, please\Ntalk, why won't you talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.05,0:07:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, talk to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,god?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're alive, how is that even\Npossible, bastard, you took their souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously as making dolls is my hobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but of course ordinary doll makers cannot\Nimbue their handiwork with human souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I may be giving too much\Naway, but that's my Stan's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comparatively my brother's collection of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simple coins made of souls\Nis rather uninspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my collection you can play\Ndress up and have actual chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little showstopper is named Sonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can wax poetic about her passionate\Nlove stories Such exquisite skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone would be proud to own her. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elliot is a serial killer\Nwith a victim count of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll tell you all about\Nthe patients he's killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the glasses and stethoscope myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I nearly forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to meet Tatsuhiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's a game expert from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This brilliant young man was a\Nformidable opponent with an IQ of 190.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, it wasn't easy beating\Nthis little guy and stealing his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just as messed up in\Nthe head as your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're more sadistic\Nthan your brother ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to see what your parents were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of patience with\Nthis sociopath's puppet show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm fairly certain you\Nlearned this when you fought my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the human soul can be\Na rather mysterious entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment a person admits defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:09:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their inner spirit dies, and the\Nsoul loses almost all vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I have the power\Nto rip the soul from the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the fundamental\Nmechanism of our stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show and tell is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna beat you to a bloody\Npulp and get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely, the fact that you're under my\Ncontrol hasn't escaped your notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.57,0:09:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were quite shocked when I knew exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which arm you were\Ngoing to attack me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from where I'm standing, it seems\Nyou still haven't figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were shaken by my prowess and I was\Nable to give your soul a little love tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I did\Nwhen I touched your soul?
