Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell did you do to his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing but embed a\Ntomb's hand inside Jotaro's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could crush your\Nright arm with a thought
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in doing so make\NMaster Dio very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to\Ndefend myself against
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin and Joseph and\Nwould most certainly perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we wouldn't want that to\Nhappen, would we, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here's a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's play a game\Nwith our souls as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you defeat me, I solemnly\Nswear to release Jotaro's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So according to you, I'm\Nalready under your control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have news for you, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret picking a\Nfight with me and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, your righteous\Nanger is all well and good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather hear you say the\Nwords, I'll bet my soul on this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I have another\Nrequest if you'd indulge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you shall be my first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fight is with me, buddy, so don't\Ntry and pass the buck to Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kakyoin is decidedly not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer Kakyoin not back\Nout of our arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And attack me with his stand after\NI've taken both of your souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,due to lack of familial attachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this arrogant prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks this challenge is going\Nto be a walk in the park for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\Nthen I will be your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what? Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really not too concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've probably played more video\Ngames than anyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I officially accept your challenge\Nand choose F Mega as our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll wager my soul!
