Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll wager my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick Wing, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you\Nto take this guy on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't have a\Ngrasp on that spirit hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could hinder your game-playing ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do I have your guarantee\Nthat you'll release
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro from your stand's\Npower if you lose the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
