Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.57,0:12:22.61,SFXPurple3 - Copy,6.2,0,0,0,,{=11}{\blur0.7\pos(962.031,15.281)\fade(255,0,255,-2590,-2589,79,80)\c&H000000&}Menacing
