Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.61,0:12:22.65,SFXPurple3 - Copy,6.2,0,0,0,,{=11}{\bord0\blur0.7\pos(961.434,18.001)\fade(255,0,255,-2630,-2629,39,40)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The TV console and game\Ncartridges are all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I can tell, this\Nis just an ordinary setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep trying to tell you that\NI'm not a cheater like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're ready, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F★Mega!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select your car!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and select your vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've decided to go with number 28.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll be number 15,\Nas my birthday is January 5th.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can begin at your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start the game already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Race starts in five!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's button-mashing the\Naccelerator at an incredible speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going for a Tribe start! Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to try the Sing tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he just cut me off. As\Nlong as I'm in the lead, he
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't beat me and I've made\Nit impossible for him to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pass it's unfortunate I\Nknow but the simple truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never make a mistake during a\NVictory will be mine, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you've played this\Ngame before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not reveal that. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your chance, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your machine back on course and\Nstart kicking this bastard's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:14:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One doesn't simply get those skills\Nby playing video games! Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never could have\Nimagined that someone as
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,measured as Kakyoin would\Nmake such a bold move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the way to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neck and neck! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look carefully, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin's at the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to those turns,\Nhe's at a major disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,355 kmh, now it's 358, and now 360,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three seconds until the first turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way I can\Nmake it going this fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm entering the turn at full speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are hitting the\Nturns the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too close to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:15:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've intrigued me, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your soul on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've conquered your fear and become\Nthe picture of unwavering resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say you'll make a worthy\Naddition to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for me to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin thought to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I've conquered my fears, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six months ago, I had the unfortunate\Nexperience of meeting your master, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was terrified when he implanted\None of his flesh buds in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories of that day\Nare as clear as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the horror I felt in\Nmy soul as I faced that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs wouldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every hair on my body stood on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I was frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was helpless, completely at his mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mere sight of Dio was enough\Nto turn my own body against itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach was in knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so close to vomiting, I could\Ntaste bile in the back of my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio gazed down at me, and, as if\Ntenderly calming a frightened child,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he said, Easy, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing for you to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be friends, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still curse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard his words and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I felt all of my anxiety melt away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was completely and utterly relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought, I still have a chance to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive him for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll never forgive myself for\Nsubmitting to that bastard's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My weakness will forever\Nbe my greatest failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro saved me from that hell, which\Nis why I've come on this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never again allow\Nmyself to be such a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, Darby, is why I'm able to fight\Nyou even with my very soul on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're neck and neck again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rounding the third corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why, on this day, I vow that I,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriaki Kakyoin, will never be\Ncontrolled by my fears again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word is my bond! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the fifth corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back in sync!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're turning at the same speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Kakyoin! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth corner is coming up fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, the speed\Ntunnel comes right after turn six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you enter that tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.97,0:18:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're granted a boost that can\Ndouble your max speed to 850 kmh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure I get to that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thing is, the tunnel's\Nonly wide enough for one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they try to enter the tunnel side\Nby side, one of them is going to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the sixth turn, and\Nthey're still neck and neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, push him out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized it yet, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the power to push me aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, why not\Nglance at your handy-dandy power meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hakui, you have less power than he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used up your power\Nwhen you spun around and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blocked me back at the\Nbeginning of the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the best move on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're regretting that decision now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two seconds till the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can let this fool have the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get behind him to avoid\Ncrashing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he makes it to the tunnel first, my\Nchances of winning go to absolute zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second left till victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocaine!
