Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.43,0:19:43.51,SFXOang,7,0,0,0,,{=21}{\bord0\blur0.6\frz358.5\pos(1358.57,827.51)\4a&HFF&}Grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got the car up on two wheels!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How absurd you're riding the tunnel walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes you've got this in the\Nbed Kakyoin just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit further and\Nvictory will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now push him aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet I'm concentrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out he's slamming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference to\Nme if I lose some power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only concern is getting around\Nthat turn faster than Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's only by a\Nhundredth of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one one-thousandth\Nof a millimeter ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.81,0:20:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't see the cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we have to get through\Nthe tunnel in almost absolute darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is my radar\Nwill be completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are eight turns, a landmine,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a cannon attack waiting to\Nput us through our paces up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area will remain\Ndark until we make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.65,0:20:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mistake and I'll slam into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fortunately for us, I already\Nknow exactly where each turn is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby knows, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.81,0:20:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cars are beginning to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell who's ahead or where\Nthey are in that blasted tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, and one. Cannon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there, the\Nblast lit up the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.27,0:21:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that cocky-o-ing\Nis running slightly behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're about to exit the tunnel.
