Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be foolish enough\Nto let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weaker car loses in a collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be kicking this guy's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just back out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst pep\Ntalk I've ever heard.
